%description:
Tests that the strict cookie check of a Fast Open server takes only a cookie
of fastopenCookieBytes (8). The scenario is that of tcp_fastopen_1, and the
tester cuts the cookie of the SYN of connection 2 to its first 4 bytes. The
server does not accept the cookie: its SYN-ACK acknowledges only the SYN and
gives the cookie of 8 bytes again, and the data goes after the handshake.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.cli_app.fastOpen=true
*.cli_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.cli_app.active2=true
*.cli_app.localPort2=1001
*.cli_app.tSend2=0.5s
*.cli_app.sendBytes2=200B
*.cli_app.fastOpen2=true
*.srv_app.tOpen2=0.5s
*.srv_app.localPort2=2000

*.cli_tcp.fastopenClientEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.fastopenServerEnabled = true
*.tcptester.script="a3 cookie 4"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[0.501 A003] A.1001 > B.2000: S 125000:125200(200) win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=4)# cutting the Fast Open cookie
srv_tcp: LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD  (on RCV_SYN)
[0.503 B002] A.1001 < B.2000: A S 125500:125500(0) ack 125001 win 16384   Option(s): MaxSegSize NOP NOP FastOpen(cookieLen=8)
cli_tcp: SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED  (on RCV_SYN_ACK)
[0.505 A004] A.1001 > B.2000: A 125001:125201(200) ack 125501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
